  "rationales": {"U":"原文使用抽象元概念'what must be accomplished'和未定义术语'vision'、'concept of operations (ConOps)'，缺乏上下文约束，读者无法判断该陈述是定义性说明还是可执行需求；证据片段：'what must be accomplished to fulfill the vision described in a concept of ope rations (ConOps)' — 其中'vision'和'ConOps'均未在需求中定义或链接，且'ope rations'存在明显拼写错误'ope rations'，进一步损害可理解性","A":"'a system requirements specification states...' 是对文档类型的描述性断言，而非对系统行为或属性的约束；'states what must be accomplished' 存在双重模糊：'states'指文档动作（非系统行为），'what must be accomplished'无量化、无主体、无验收条件；证据片段：'A system requirements specification states...' — 主语是文档而非系统，违反需求应描述系统能力的基本原则","C":"该陈述在工程实践中常被用作标准定义（如IEEE 29148），基本事实正确，但将'SRS'定义为'what must be accomplished'过度简化——SRS应包含外部接口、约束、质量属性等非功能性内容；证据片段：'states what must be accomplished' — 忽略非功能需求与约束，完整性存疑，故Correctness得分受限","V":"无可观测判据：无法通过测试、检查或演示验证该陈述是否成立；既无明确输入/输出，也无判定'SRS fulfills vision'的客观标准；证据片段：'to fulfill the vision described in a concept of ope rations' — 'fulfill the vision'不可测量、不可证伪，且'vision'未形式化定义"},
  "suggestions": {"U":"Replace with atomic definition using controlled vocabulary: 'The System Requirements Specification (SRS) document shall contain all functional requirements, external interface requirements, system constraints, and quality attribute requirements necessary to realize the operational capabilities defined in the approved Concept of Operations (ConOps) document.'","A":"Keep the revised version above; it eliminates document-as-agent phrasing ('states') and replaces vague 'what must be accomplished' with enumerated, standardized SRS content categories.","C":"Revise to align with ISO/IEC/IEEE 29148:2018, which defines SRS scope as including functional, interface, constraint, and quality requirements — thus correcting the omission implied by 'what must be accomplished'.","V":"Replace with testable statement: 'The SRS document shall include traceability identifiers linking each requirement to a capability statement in the approved ConOps document, and the traceability matrix shall achieve 100% coverage of all ConOps capability statements.'"},
