    {"type":"A","evidence":"A system requirements specification states what must be accomplished","rewrite":"The System Requirements Specification (SRS) document shall contain all functional requirements, external interface requirements, system constraints, and quality attribute requirements necessary to realize the operational capabilities defined in the approved Concept of Operations (ConOps) document."},
    {"type":"V","evidence":"to fulfill the vision described in a concept of ope rations (ConOps)","rewrite":"The SRS document shall include traceability identifiers linking each requirement to a capability statement in the approved ConOps document, and the traceability matrix shall achieve 100% coverage of all ConOps capability statements."}
